    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join us on <strong>DISCORD</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/feb4af184e4ff9135c74f9c80a110635.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/feb4af184e4ff9135c74f9c80a110635.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a determined programmer in 'Game is Full of Bugs,' who finds himself unexpectedly drafted into a desperate struggle against an alien invasion of bugs. Despite being brought into the fray under the guise of a misunderstanding, his knowledge and craftiness quickly proves invaluable in this dire situation. Get ready and enter the hive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENHANCE YOUR MAGAZINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect leftover pieces of your fallen foes and use them to craft unique bullets and modules to improve the \u201cmagazine printing\u201d fabricator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/ad39af3dce4c33dff118af3b7ac9c228.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/ad39af3dce4c33dff118af3b7ac9c228.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND POWERFUL COMBOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your arsenal by discovering new bullet types, experiment with countless module and item combinations and create the ultimate weapon to combat the bug incursion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/523671b904ded3065b330de4c6e6fd18.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/523671b904ded3065b330de4c6e6fd18.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE HIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the randomly generated cave, fight your way through hordes of bugs and eliminate the queen that lurks within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/8c27caf35a80b84c70ad61a1a9b26c78.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/8c27caf35a80b84c70ad61a1a9b26c78.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join us on <strong>DISCORD</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/feb4af184e4ff9135c74f9c80a110635.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/feb4af184e4ff9135c74f9c80a110635.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a determined programmer in 'Game is Full of Bugs,' who finds himself unexpectedly drafted into a desperate struggle against an alien invasion of bugs. Despite being brought into the fray under the guise of a misunderstanding, his knowledge and craftiness quickly proves invaluable in this dire situation. Get ready and enter the hive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENHANCE YOUR MAGAZINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect leftover pieces of your fallen foes and use them to craft unique bullets and modules to improve the \u201cmagazine printing\u201d fabricator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/ad39af3dce4c33dff118af3b7ac9c228.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/ad39af3dce4c33dff118af3b7ac9c228.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND POWERFUL COMBOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your arsenal by discovering new bullet types, experiment with countless module and item combinations and create the ultimate weapon to combat the bug incursion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/523671b904ded3065b330de4c6e6fd18.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/523671b904ded3065b330de4c6e6fd18.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE HIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the randomly generated cave, fight your way through hordes of bugs and eliminate the queen that lurks within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/8c27caf35a80b84c70ad61a1a9b26c78.poster.avif?t=1749189851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/8c27caf35a80b84c70ad61a1a9b26c78.webm?t=1749189851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
